   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "bXnRjRgZw9sy"
   },
   "source": [
    "# Microbial Pathway using HumanN2\n",
    "HumanN2 installation and source code (https://github.com/biobakery/biobakery/wiki/humann2), gene families are annotated using UniRef90 identifiers and pathways using MetaCyc IDs. All HumanN2 report files are merged into a .tsv file and processed using the HumanN2 Rscript. For more details of the HumanN2 analysis please refer to file [HumanN2 Analysis](HumanN2_analysis.R)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "os8Ickq5GqEe"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "humann2 --input file.fastq --output file_fastq \n"
   ]
  },
{
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
