   },
   "source": [
    "# Beta Diversity Analysis\n",
    "Beta Diversity Analysis using output from Metaphlan2, calculated using Bray Curtis using phyloseq and vegan packages in RStudio, please refer to file [Beta Diversity Analysis](Beta_Diversity.R) \n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "os8Ickq5GqEe"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "install.packages(phyloseq) \n",
    "install.packages(vegan) \n"
   ]
  },
